Package: libpulse0
Version: @DEB_PULSEAUDIO_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/PulseAudio/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libsndfile1, libintl8
Provides: libpulse-simple0
Conflicts: libpulse-simple-xios0
Replaces: libpulse-simple-xios0
Description: PulseAudio client libraries
 libpulse, libpulse-simple and libpulse-mainloop-glib, built without the
 daemon. GNOME Shell's volume control (gvc) links these; with no PulseAudio
 server running the connection stays idle.
 .
 This ships the real libpulse-simple.0.dylib and supersedes the audio track's
 libpulse-simple-xios0 stopgap shim (which existed only because Procursus had no
 PulseAudio); apt removes the shim on install.
